{"seq":9,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-gbrain-told-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r1","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:07:43.690Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"bfab6cad8f9699507ff539b32769e784a4fcdcdf6bf7057472ab762a510ca10a","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests show. They only name owners indirectly, for example \"Gideon's biggest account\", so check the CRM before the slide goes out.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was \"Nadia's biggest account\" in the July 2025 digest. The May 4, 2026 digest says Nadia's old industrial account was reassigned in the CRM that day, and the digests from August 2026 on call it \"Gideon's biggest account\". **Vantorre Group changed hands on May 4, 2026**, from Nadia Fennimore to Gideon.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. The digests call it \"Gideon's fleet account\" from March 2025 through the 9/30 digest. The May 4 digest also says he \"assumed management\" of it that day. That wording is odd, because he already looked like the owner. I would still treat Gideon as the current owner.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. It was \"Nadia's medical account\" in March 2025. The December 2025 and 9/30/2026 digests say \"Gideon's medical account\". No digest gives the date of that change. The September 2025 digest mentions an account Gideon \"took over in August\", but it doesn't name the account, so I can't tie it to Orlavine.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** I can't confirm an owner. The digests only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account\". Nadia volunteered to run its gate-clerk training in the 9/30 digest, which suggests she may own it, but no digest states that."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
